=2 Walkthrough
!Maze of Shakhrami-map1.jpg|right|Shakhrami Map 1
!Maze of Shakhrami-map2.jpg|right|Shakhrami Map 2
!Inner Horutoto Ruins-map1.jpg|right|Inner Ruins Map 1
!Inner Horutoto Ruins-map2.jpg|right|Inner Ruins Map 2
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} (one crystal is enough) to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
\**(Optional)**: As usual for {p:Windurst} Missions, the {n:Gate Guards|Gate Guard} and their adjacent NPCs will all have optional dialogue after accepting and at end of the Mission.
* Head for the {p:Optistery} on the northern map of {z:Windurst Waters} (near {p:Home Point} #1). Speak to {n:Tosuka-Porika} at (G-8) (East door).
** **(Optional)**: The other NPCs and {n:Tosuka-Porika} inside the same room have additional dialogue.
* Head to (J-3) in {z:Windurst Woods} and speak to {p:Nanaa Mihgo}. She will lend you her {@k} {k:Lapis monocle}.
** You may need to talk to her twice or more if you have a {@k} {k:Windurst Trust permit} and {p:Aht Urhgan} {q:Lure of the Wildcat|Lure of the Wildcat|Lure of the Wildcat} Quests started.
** **(Optional)**: {p:Nanaa|Nanaa Mihgo}'s cronies nearby have additional dialogue.

=3 Maze of Shakrami
* Now make your way to the {z:Maze of Shakhrami}, which is in at (K-5) in the northeast corner of {z:Tahrongi Canyon}.
** The {p:Survival Guide} places you at the entrance of {z:Maze of Shakhrami} so long as you have it unlocked.
** The {p:Unity Warp} to {z:Tahrongi Canyon}, Kulshushu {p:Outpost}, or {p:Mea crag|Crag of Mea} warps can otherwise save some time.
* Inside, head for (G-6) on Map 1, where you can transition to Map 2 (the lower map). Then, head to (H-5) on Map 2.
* Check each **Fossil Rock** until you receive the {@k} {k:Lapis coral}.
** There are 14 **Fossil Rocks** total on Map 2.
** 4 in the room at (H-5).
** 2 in the room at (I-7).
** 6 in the large room at (F-7)/(G-7)/(G-8), one of which is in the room at (F-8).
** 2 in the room at (I-8).
** Many mobs aggro {@a:Sound|Detects by Sound} sound, while {p:Goblins|Category:Goblin} will aggro to {@a:Sight|Detects by Sight} sight, so keep {p:Sneak (Status)} and {p:Invisible (Status)} up if you are a lower-level player. You can use **Circumspection** from the {p:Grounds Tome} if necessary.
* Make your way back to {p:Nanaa Mihgo}, who will give you the {@k} {k:Hideout key}.
** **(Optional)**: {p:Nanaa|Nanaa Mihgo}'s cronies have new additional dialogue.

=3 Inner Horutoto Ruins
* Head to {z:East Sarutabaruta}, and enter the **Lily Tower** at (J-7) to reach {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins}.
** The **Inner Horutoto Ruins** {p:Survival Guide} warp places you in the right tower if you have it unlocked already.
* Head to the Southwest room containing an **Ancient Magical Gizmo**. At (G-9), there is a **Cracked Wall**. Open it to proceed to {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins} Map 2. Now head for (G-8). There are a few ways to get there, but ultimately that is your destination.
** You will need {s:Sneak} and {s:Invisible} due to high level (90+) monsters in the area.
*** {@i:Silent Oil|4165} {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165} and {@i:Prism Powder|4164} {i:Prism Powder|Prism Powder|4164} are alternatives to {s:Sneak} and {s:Invisible}.
** This also includes potential {@a:Scent|Detects by Scent} blood aggro, so be sure you are above 75% HP.
*** Without Sneak and Invisible: {m:Beetles|Beetle} and {p:Bats|Bat} do not aggro here. There is a path to the door without {m:Goblins|Goblin} and {m:Skeletons|Skeleton}, allowing you to pass safely.
* Check the **Mahogany Door** for a cutscene.
** **(Optional)**: {p:Nanaa|Nanaa Mihgo} and her cronies back in {z:Windurst Woods} have new additional dialogue after this cutscene.

=3 Windurst
* Head to the **House of the Hero** at {z:Windurst Walls} (G-3). Check the door for a cutscene.
* Make your way back to {z:Windurst Waters} {p:Home Point} #1 and speak to {n:Tosuka-Porika} to complete the Mission.
** **(Optional)**: Some of the NPCs in the same room have new additional dialogue.

